{
  "name": "Careful Kinesis",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you use your kinetic shape with an infusion that forces other creatures to make a Saving Throw, you can protect some of those creatures from the shape's full force. To do so, you spend 1 kinesis point and choose a number of those creatures up to your Charisma modifier (minimum of one creature). A chosen creature automatically succeeds on its Saving Throws against the blast and takes no damage if it would normally take half damage on a successful save.</p>",
